<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR TUESDAY.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR TUESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Tuesday:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,501.10 (1,556.20)	CHF  1,024.30 (1,059.40)</p>
<p>    DEM    871.67 (902.93)	  GBP  2,436.60 (2,529.10)</p>
<p>    ATS    123.85 (128.33)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Monday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought   $44.56 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold     $33.29 million</p>
<p>Total turnover $77.85 million ($58.73 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
